{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17234","headline":"同陆太祝鸿渐崔法曹载华见萧侍御留後说得卫抚州报推事使张侍御却回前刺史戴员外无事喜而有作三首 二 · 权德舆","name":"同陆太祝鸿渐崔法曹载华见萧侍御留後说得卫抚州报推事使张侍御却回前刺史戴员外无事喜而有作三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤发州民拥使车，人人自说受恩初。\n如今天下无冤气，乞爲邦君雪谤书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}